  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(a) improve the quality of public urban transport in the FMR by enhancing the de velopment of a fully integrated urban transport system under the coordination of  a Regional Transport Coordination Commission (RTCC) and  rehabilitate the Metro for West Line; (b) to transfer the STU/FOR system from the Federal to the State  government;  and (c)  increase the private sector participation in the operatio n and management of the Metrofor system (West and South lines) generated text</narrative>
